## 📦 PCB Details

* 2-layer PCB
* Ground plane on bottom layer
* Optimized power routing
* Standard manufacturing constraints
* Mounting holes for enclosure integration

---

## ⚡ Key Design Decisions

* Modular flashlight instead of onboard LED for flexibility
* Separate ground considerations (BAT- vs P-) for protection circuit
* Efficient power routing for minimal losses
* SMD test points instead of through-hole for clean layout

